+### x86 `-march` and `-mtune` policy
+
+`-march=raptorlake` is accepted as an **explicit AVX2-safe subset profile**:
+it enables the existing SSE3 → SSSE3 → SSE4.1 → SSE4.2 → AVX → AVX2 lowering
